# Allow-list build context: the API image needs only requirements.txt, src/ and
# api/. Everything else (data/, adapters/, .venv/, mlruns/, notebooks/, .git/)
# stays out of the context, which keeps builds fast and secrets out of layers.
# If the Dockerfile starts copying another path, re-include it here.
*
!requirements.txt
!src
!api

# Never ship bytecode or tool caches, even from the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
